  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1102.33 Land acquisition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1102.33 “Land acquisition” means the purchase of an interest in land that is needed to complete an eligible project, whether in fee or by easement. The term includes associated professional services such as appraisals, title searches, title opinions, and title insurance.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Dw 1100) #13160, eff 1-20-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1100.html"
